{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Land of Glarefall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>An action-adventure survival game where every night could be your last.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a royal investigator sent to uncover the truth behind a mysterious energy source known as &quot;<strong>Black Gold&quot;</strong>\u2014and the terrifying creatures drawn to it.<br>Explore a vast, dangerous world where <strong>survival depends on smart resource management, tactical combat, and what you choose to do before night falls.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.poster.avif?t=1773636959\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.webm?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/a38157ce6d16edef60508b6b296790b3.mp4?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Day-Night Cycle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daytime</strong> is your window to explore, gather resources, build, and push the story forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night</strong> brings relentless waves of monsters. Prepare your defenses\u2014or be overwhelmed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.poster.avif?t=1773636959\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.webm?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/8d24dbed41aaace2b28cd9c02542c9b6.mp4?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Survive</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest wood, ore, and other materials to craft healing items, upgrade gear, and construct powerful defensive structures.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.poster.avif?t=1773636959\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.webm?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/4eca427371b29a9f95db8ae88f0afce8.mp4?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Growth &amp; Custom Skills</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from unique heroes, each with their own skill tree and progression path.<br>Tailor your build to suit your preferred combat style\u2014whether that\u2019s frontline aggression or tactical support.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.poster.avif?t=1773636959\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.webm?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/2fa9e217cd4915c59ca77162fcb54ab7.mp4?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruitable Mercenary System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build outposts to hire and upgrade mercenaries who can support you in combat and hold the line during nightfall assaults.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.poster.avif?t=1773636959\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.webm?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/f24d13ceb75488cecefc153f88122978.mp4?t=1773636959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Boss Hunt Encounters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful bosses in special large-scale map events.<br>Utilize terrain, deploy defenses, and lead mercenaries into battle\u2014or pour all your resources into yourself and take on the boss <strong>one-on-one</strong> in a duel of strength and strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836120/extras/d3f1a558d969d7d6e30872db76619872.poster.avif?t=1773636959\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st